### references/canvas-schema.md  [docs]
+ # Canvas Schema for bear-share-sync
+ ## Node Layout
+ Share-sourced nodes use these attributes:
+ | Field | Value | Notes |
+ |---|---|---|
+ | `id` | `share-{bear_note_id}` | Prefixed to avoid collisions |
+ | `type` | `text` | Always text nodes |
+ | `color` | `"4"` | Green — distinguishes share-sourced nodes |
+ | `width` | `260` | Fixed width for consistency |
+ | `height` | `160` | Default; increase for long content |
+ | `text` | `**{title}**\n{excerpt}` | Markdown with bold title |
+ ## Positioning Algorithm
+ - Grid layout: 40px gap between nodes
+ - Row wrap at 1200px total width
+ - New rows start below the tallest node in the previous row
+ - Origin (0,0) at top-left
+ ## Canvas File Format
+ Standard JSON Canvas 1.0:
+ ```json
+ {
+   "nodes": [...],
+   "edges": [...]
+ }
+ ```
+ The skill only appends to `nodes` and does not modify existing nodes or edges.

